@title From Donation to Tax Receipt
@subtitle How a gift is recorded, approved, receipted and claimed at Riverside Literacy Trust

Every gift ends the same way: it is entered in the donor database, checked against two rules (size and address), receipted, and, where it qualifies, added to the Gift Aid claim. This page follows one gift through every branch.

